# Where a plan that starts now should start, so it can be spliced onto the path being flown.
# The controller remembers the answer: the next FollowPath goal is joined there.
float64 lookahead_time    # [s] expected planning time: the reference keeps moving meanwhile
bool from_end             # plan the next segment from the end of the current one
---
bool following            # false: not following a path, start = the hold position
geometry_msgs/Point start
